        "text": "In 1999, author and web designer Darcy Denucci coined Web 2.0 to distinguish it from Web 1.0. Web 2.0 refers to the shift towards a more interactive Internet focused on the users participating and contributing to the web. If web 1.0 is the read only web, then web 2.0 is the read and write Web or participatory Web. This platform, Centric Web 2.0, emphasizes user generated content and portals such as social media platforms, blogs, and podcasts. It also features improved interactivity as the user experience moves from static to dynamic. Short video apps, for example, give each user a customized interaction with user generated content based on personal interests and algorithmic recommendations.",
